/P 95 0 R
/E (In the second part, we analyzed the draft and the question everyone asks: is a Top 5 pick really worth it? The data shows that Top 5 picks average 211 more points per season compared to Late 1st Round picks, which is a significant difference. However, this does not mean there are no hidden gems in picks 15-30. We can see that even from the Lottery and Late 1st Round, there are players who reach Elite level. So draft position matters, but it is not an absolute guarantee of success.)
